          Text(
            label,
            style: TextStyle(
                color: color, fontSize: 10, fontWeight: FontWeight.w500),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }
}

class _Badge extends StatelessWidget {
  final String label;
  final Color color;

  const _Badge({required this.label, required this.color});

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
